; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1711                   ServiceCall. The ServiceCall is passed as argument to the caller. The correctness of the caller
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1712                   argument is ensured by precondition. PrevApplication is initialized in Os_ServicePrologue. Precondition
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1713                   ensures that Os_ServicePrologue is called before. The compliance of the preconditions is check during
